  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after **interchanging the given two signs and numbers** :\n\n \n• **× and ÷**\n \n• **7 and 9**\n\nSo,\n\n__**Option - (1) : 9 – 7 × 2 + 6 ÷ 3 = 11**__\n\n7 – __**9 ÷ 2**__ + 6 × 3 = 11\n\n7 - 4.5 + __**6 × 3**__ = 11\n\n__**7 + 18**__ - 4.5 = 11\n\n__**25 - 4.5**__ = 11\n\n**20.5 ≠ 11 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n\n__**Option - (2) : 9 + 4 × 3 – 7 ÷ 1 = 40**__\n\n7 + __**4 ÷ 3**__ – 9 × 1 = 40\n\n7 + 1.33 – __**9**____** × **____**1**__ = 40\n\n__**7 + 1.33**__ - 9 = 40\n\n__**8.33 - 9**__ = 40\n\n**0.67 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n\n**__Option - (3) : 8 × 3 ÷ 6 + 9 – 7 = 14__**\n\n__**8 ÷ 3**__ × 6 + 7 – 9 = 14\n\n__**2.67 ×**____** 6**__ + 7 - 9 = 14\n\n__**16 + 7**__ - 9 = 14\n\n__**23 - 9**__ = 14\n\n**14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n\n__**Option - (4) : 9 × 3 + 4 ÷ 2 – 7 = 18**__\n\n__**7 ÷ 3**__ + 4 × 2 – 9 = 18\n\n3.5 + __**4 ×**____** 2**__ – 9 = 18\n\n__**3.5 + 8**__ - 9 = 18\n\n__**11.5 - 9**__ = 18\n\n**2.5 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
